WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.208
Step 1: Sign in to OpStack console as an owner and open Billing. Start with Sandbox and enter a reporting API access token from the matching GoCardless dashboard. Blank fields preserve saved credentials.

2
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:24.292
Step 2: Set the server’s APP_ORIGIN to the public HTTPS app address. Register the webhook address shown in Billing in the same GoCardless environment, enter the matching webhook signing secret and Save connection. Keep Sandbox and Live credentials separate.

3
00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:36.125
Step 3: Choose Test connection &amp; sync. Wait for Connected and a completed sync time. Every import reads all pages before replacing the prior snapshot; failures retain the last successful data and show an error.

4
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:47.333
Step 4: Match each imported AUD subscription to its OpStack network and location. Choose Save location links and confirm that the links apply to imported history. Unlinked payments stay outside location collection totals.

5
00:00:47.333 --> 00:01:01.667
Step 5: Enable automatic sync and Save connection. Verified notifications queue a refresh; the server also checks periodically at 15-minute intervals. It resumes checks after restarts while the approving account remains an active owner. Manage subscriptions, debit authorities and payment changes in GoCardless.

6
00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:16.000
Step 6: Open Monthly report → Collections. Live is the default; select Sandbox explicitly to inspect test results. Confirmed payments, pending amounts, failures, refunds and chargebacks appear by location. Paid payouts and deducted fees are account-wide. Sales retains configured fees, separately from Collections.
